    "message": "Count a high-distress recovery that happens during event handling\n\nThe distress monitor closed a run only when the psychology update itself\ncrossed the threshold. Staff support can lower distress while events\nare handled, so the next update saw both values low, left the run open\nand later overwrote it without counting the recovery (#159). A run now\ncloses whenever either value is below the threshold, and a rise in the\nsame update starts a new episode.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
